  "description": "Four ECC83 triodes in Lead Hi Gain mode, with its four-band tone network and instrument send divider. Contour off. Fixed supply rails. The output is the line out after the return buffer, with the TBA820M headphone amplifier and its 4 Ω load hanging on the buffer.",
